1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,392
Everyone is a little strange. Serve the odd ones. Refuse whoever isn't on camera.

2
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:09,684
Night one. Don't mess it up.

3
00:00:14,349 --> 00:00:17,242
Ten skewers. Cook them until they stop talking.

4
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:22,380
...Okay. The customer is always right.

5
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:24,188
Check the camera.

6
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:27,009
On camera. Just weird.

7
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:30,085
Don't ask. Just cook.

8
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:38,242
Payment.

9
00:00:38,522 --> 00:00:40,132
...That's a leaf.

10
00:00:40,412 --> 00:00:41,733
It is very valuable.

11
00:00:42,013 --> 00:00:43,126
Fine. Serve.

12
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:46,098
Next.

13
00:00:49,330 --> 00:00:52,067
Iced tea. Less sugar. Less... you.

14
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:57,437
Okay. Normal. She is... only staring.

15
00:00:57,987 --> 00:00:59,245
Check the camera.

16
00:01:00,387 --> 00:01:02,024
...Nobody there.

17
00:01:02,304 --> 00:01:03,756
She is not on camera.

18
00:01:07,787 --> 00:01:09,693
Refuse. Refuse. REFUSE.

19
00:01:13,987 --> 00:01:14,741
Closing.

20
00:01:17,987 --> 00:01:19,949
Next night. Who isn't human?
